===Eliminate any 15 targets in one raid on Interchange===
You must get 15 kills on [[Interchange]] in one raid. If you don't eliminate 15 targets, it is possible to transit between [[Interchange]] and [[Interchange#Transits|other maps]] to complete the objective. However, the kills need to be performed on [[Interchange]] even if transits are used. If you extract without the necessary eliminations, both this and the previous objective will need to be completed again.

===Talk to [[Lightkeeper]]===
Visit [[Lightkeeper]] and talk to him on [[Lighthouse]]. You will need to have an empty special slot in order to be able to accept the reward.

====Rewards====
* 1x [[Armored case]]

===Ask [[Mechanic]] for help===
Visit [[Mechanic]] in the menu through the trader screen to ask for help. To unlock the [[Armored case]] you will need his help.

