====Eliminate any 50 targets on [[Streets of Tarkov]]====
You need to eliminate 50 targets on [[Streets of Tarkov]]. The eliminations can be completed across multiple raids.

====Eliminate 4 PMC operatives in one raid====
You need to eliminate 4 PMC operatives on any map in one raid. Transits can be used if not enough PMCs are found in a single raid.

